# Hung build_runner recovery

`dart run build_runner` in `mobile/app` often hangs. Do not restart it immediately after a kill.

Recovery order (from `mobile/app`):

1. Kill the hung `build_runner` / `dart` process.
2. Clean generated build state: `dart run build_runner clean`
3. Restart: `dart run build_runner build --delete-conflicting-outputs` (or `watch` if that was the original command)

Never skip step 2 after a hang or forced kill. A clean restart avoids repeated hangs from stale build caches.
